  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"627\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">这是一个旨在改善游戏体验的简单模组，它增加了一种我们一开始就拥有的新食物——我们心爱的水！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在，玩家可以装满一个简单的玻璃罐水，然后饮用，恢复半格食物和半颗心。就是这么简单！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友一起玩的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"285\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在寻找一个服务器，以便与朋友一起玩任何模组或整合包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是你的解决方案！他们提供质量价格比最佳的Minecraft服务器，如果你点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>，使用代码“Lupin”将享受25%的折扣。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Summary.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">还有什么比喝水更基本的呢？实际上，在大多数视频游戏中，你可以喝水，这通常会给你一点奖励……现在在Minecraft中你也可以做到了！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当你喝水时，你会同时恢复半格食物和半颗心！人们常说喝水才能生存……虽然这不是必须的，但肯定对你有帮助！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组能在服务器上工作吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！它完美运行！请记住，与模组和朋友游玩的最佳方式是通过BisectHosting，而<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接你可以获得25%的折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然！前提是它只能发布在Modrinth或CurseForge上。上传到任何其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，是完全不允许的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">但是，如果你考虑将其添加到你的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包中，我们非常感激。如果你需要任何小的改动或有任何问题，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制这个模组的视频并在我的频道上展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，你可以自由地在你频道上玩这个模组或我们的任何整合包并制作视频，事实上，我们对此非常感激！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/284/healthy-water-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/285/healthy-water-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/287/healthy-water-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
